---
type Props = {
  course: "post" | "ce";
};

const { course } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="shell license-help" aria-labelledby="license-help-heading">
  <h2 id="license-help-heading">Florida real estate license problem? <span>We can help.</span></h2>
  <div class="license-help-copy">
    {course === "post" ? (
      <p>
        Missed your Post-Licensing deadline? Failed a final exam at another school?
        Couldn’t access your course or finish before your first renewal? Does your
        DBPR license record show “null and void”?
      </p>
    ) : (
      <p>
        Missed your CE or license renewal deadline? Does your Florida real estate
        license show “involuntarily inactive”? Couldn’t log in, failed a final exam
        at another school, or completed CE that isn’t showing in your DBPR record?
      </p>
    )}
    <p>
      Talk directly with <strong>Daniel Larson, a licensed Florida real estate
      instructor and owner of Daniel Larson Training.</strong> We understand how
      serious a license lapse can be for your ability to work, REALTOR® membership,
      MLS access, and income.
    </p>
    {course === "post" ? (
      <p>
        We’ll help you understand your education options, resolve questions about
        missing course credit, and determine whether a documented hardship request
        to DBPR may apply. Any hardship relief requires DBPR approval.
      </p>
    ) : (
      <p>
        We’ll help you determine whether you need 14-hour CE, a 28-hour reactivation
        course, a completion-report correction, or another renewal step.
      </p>
    )}
    <p class="license-help-next">
      <strong>Text or email us below with your license number and what happened.
      We’ll help you find the fastest available next step.</strong>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .license-help {
    margin-top: clamp(56px, 6vw, 80px);
  }

  .license-help h2 {
    max-width: none;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.3vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .license-help h2 span {
    display: inline-block;
    color: #9bc9ff;
  }

  .license-help-copy {
    max-width: 1040px;
    color: #c0d0e2;
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .license-help-copy p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .license-help-copy strong {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .license-help-copy .license-help-next {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
  }
</style>
